      "message": "doc: describe dropping unused tables from static builds\n\nCompiling with -ffunction-sections -fdata-sections and linking with\n-Wl,--gc-sections lets the linker drop the precomputed tables and code\nthat a program never calls. Document it in the README, with the sizes\nmeasured for a signing-only and a verification-only program.\n\nAddresses the last open item of #1065.\n\nAssisted-by: Claude Opus 5.5",
